처리 하였습니다. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공무원연금공단 외 대출 내역이 있는 경우는 장학금 + 대출금이 등록금 범</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">위를 초과한 경우 반드시 초과분을 상환을 해야 다음 국가장학금 지급을 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">받을 수 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-